    "TitleKey": "Battaglia_RPT_CreateUplink_01_title",
    "Description": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Moraine Movements\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nThis is a little outside our usual purview, but with the Moraine attacking more often, we\u2019re hoping to find out where they\u2019re operating and steer crews clear of those areas.\n\nWe need someone to <EM4>infiltrate a suspected Moraine facility and plug a small listening device into their server</EM4>. We\u2019ve been told that the station is rarely occupied but <EM4>it\u2019s possible that you will encounter Moraine there</EM4>, so be careful.\n\nWhile we don\u2019t advocate violence, the potential benefits of this intel will be able to save many lives on both sides.\n\nPAYMENT:\nStandard listed rate upon successful installation.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
    "DescriptionKey": "Battaglia_RPT_CreateUplink_01_desc",
